HEADER ROW:
  Left: 
    ← Back to Applications (href="/applications")
    H1: "Blast Radius Explorer — {appShort}"
    Subtitle (italic, #666, 14px):
      impact:  "If {appShort} fails → who breaks?"
      failure: "For {appShort} to run → what must 
                stay healthy?"
  Right:
    [Impact Analysis] [Failure Risk] pill toggle
    [⬇ Export CSV] button

METRIC CARDS:
  Reuse MetricCards component directly.
  Same props as in BlastRadiusPanel.

HOP BREAKDOWN BAR:
  Horizontal bars, one per hop:

  Hop 1  [████░░░░░░░░]  {hop1Count} apps
  Hop 2  [████████░░░░]  {hop2Count} apps (cumulative)
  Hop 3  [████████████]  {hop3Count} apps (cumulative)

  Bar width = (cumulativeCount / totalCount) * 100%
  Bar color = hop color (coral/amber/gray)
  Clicking a bar row changes active depth 
  (same as depth selector in popup)
  Active row: bold label, colored left border 3px

