Export CSV button downloads all nodes as CSV:

  Columns:
    App Short, Full Name, Hop, Incoming Deps,
    Outgoing Deps, Risk Level, Sample Path,
    Technology Area, Technology Group

  Filename: 
    blast-radius-{appShort}-{date}.csv

  Risk Level computed same as RiskTable.

  Use plain JS Blob + URL.createObjectURL,
  no external library.

